{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/it/reviews/id1713047807"}, "name":{"label":"Ruggi04_"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-21T10:24:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.13"}, "id":{"label":"12919306949"}, "title":{"label":"Very fun app, but.."}, "content":{"label":"The app is very good, my friends and I have a lot of fun using it, but I have several suggestions for improvement, hoping for a future update. First of all, I think it would be better to remove the subscription option for longer games, and instead give users freedom, perhaps by inserting ads during the game (without being overly aggressive). Furthermore, the ability to refresh TikTok account videos whenever they want should be included (otherwise, they always end up being the same). IMPORTANT: Please correct the video format; they're all zoomed in, and often it's hard to tell what's happening. Photos should also be added, since many people, for example, have sequences of photos in their reposts. Finally, the option to hide your own video at the end of the voting process could be revised. Since it's easy to see who's earning points, it's easy to see whose video it is. I really hope you'll consider these improvements to make it a better app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/it/review?id=6742410648&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicazione"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-04T03:30:25-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Recensioni dei clienti"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
